<title>USA: U.S. stocks move higher at opening.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks move higher at opening.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks moved higher at the opening on Monday with some billion dollar takeovers spurring action.</p>
<p>The release of November leading indicators, up 0.1 percent and in line with forecasts, was said to have had scant effect on the market.</p>
<p>In early trade the Dow Industrial Average was up 12 to 6573.</p>
